Real HWP 5.0 samples for the endue.docs tests

table.hwp, picture.hwp, notes.hwp, header.hwp and numbering.hwp come from the sample files of
hwplib (https://github.com/neolord0/hwplib, commit 6746c27f17ebf5277493206284aa32044a1839c4,
folder sample_hwp/basic: 표.hwp, 그림.hwp, 각주미주.hwp, 머리글꼬리글.hwp, 문단번호 1-10 수준.hwp),
written by Hangul and published under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0; the same text as this repository's LICENSE).

Changes: make.mjs in this folder re-packs each compound file keeping only the FileHeader, DocInfo,
BodyText and BinData streams (the summary information, preview, script and option streams are left
out) and replaces every BinData picture with the repository's own 2-by-2 test PNG. The records
Hangul wrote are otherwise unchanged. No code from hwplib is used.
